"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938283","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4322180-1844751498228085","game_id":"steam-4322180","kind":"announcement","title":"Coffin Hunter Demo - New Steam Store imagery and more!","summary":"Hello Hunters, Here is an important update for the DEMO of Coffin Hunter.We have new shutter door images and animations, the story and multiple Epilogue backgrounds have all be reworked and due to changes, also reanimated. NazaSketches finished the few different single elements I asked for so I could completely recreate the entire Steam Store imagery for the main game and the Demo. The was the second part of the \"get rid of AI placeholders\" polish pass. Check out the new Store and Library images","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T21:13:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4322180-1844115010498928","game_id":"steam-4322180","kind":"announcement","title":"Coffin Hunter Demo - Replacing AI generated fullscreen placeholders","summary":"Hello Hunters, Here is an important update for the DEMO of Coffin Hunter completely based on player feedback. and it's absolutely huge!In light of the fact that I used some ai generated concept art as placeholders and was completely transparent about this, I have still received a minor amount of unfair backlash about it that lead to the ban of one person on Reddit accusing me directly of being a thief and saying other hateful things without knowing any of the background of this game and its year","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T13:41:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498928","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4322180-1842846814451256","game_id":"steam-4322180","kind":"update","title":"Coffin Hunter Demo - Tutorial&Tips Update","summary":"Hello Hunters, Here is an important update for the DEMO of Coffin Hunter completely based on player feedback. I have seen a youtube basically breakdown on camera. That 30 minute video taught me a LOT. Coupled with understanding a negative review on the Demo, I have created a well planned tutorial experience for new players. All of the things these 2 player did not see, avoided reading, forgot, didn't understand, have now been made crystal clear in an objectives oriented tutorial. The tutorial ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T16:56:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451256","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4322180-1842212951305470","game_id":"steam-4322180","kind":"update","title":"Coffin Hunter Demo - 29 August Update","summary":"Hello Hunters,Here is a small but important update based on player feedback. - Added a difficulty reminder after beginning three hunts. It points players to Options, where difficulty can be changed at any time.- Added Display Presets for 1920x1080 and 1280x720 displays.- Added compact UI themes for the 1280 display preset.- Improved windowed-mode behaviour and display-setting application. Fullscreen uses your monitor’s native resolution. On 2560×1440 and 4K 16:9 displays, the game layout scales ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T11:39:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951305470","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4322180-1826992588592080","game_id":"steam-4322180","kind":"update","title":"Massive Pre-release update","summary":"Hello future Coffin Hunters!Over the past month, Coffin Hunter has undergone a huge pre-release overhaul.Since the store page went live, I’ve been expanding and rebuilding nearly every part of the game: story, progression, weapons, enemies, crafting, visuals, audio, events, and balance.What’s newA complete story pathThe game now features a new and completed story, a final boss fight, and 4 possible endings. You now have a real goal: pay off your debt to the Helix, and you decide how it ends. No ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-12T11:02:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588592080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:43:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4322180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:49Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4322180":"2026-10-26T02:10:49Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4322180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5085490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4322180","app_id":4322180,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a96d625f3af3361f88cadc622513a12514501e2b870396784615fe45aaac0957","response_sha256":null,"s